<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Execute a given console command.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>This is debug only as it executes <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Console%20command" title="Console command (page does not exist)">console command</a> directly instead of sending a message to the client
</p><p>In the release version of the game the only console command that is still enabled is "runscript", rendering this function largely pointless.
</p>
